*Resume CMD PING*: 

Ping measures the round-trip time for messages sent from the originating host to a destination computer that are echoed back to the source. 

*Valid arg*:
- ip 
- domain name : ex - google.com
- v : Provides more detailed output about each ping request and response

*Exec command receive*
- ping -v
